  "semantic_neighbor_review": "The new cycle repeats model-role assignments in 45 positions; r2 used a unique 30-position cycle. New cost and queue operations add resource assumptions. New Bayesian and decision-risk operations add explicit prior, loss and null models. Consent and checkpoint models add purpose/expiry/conflict and absorbing-state obligations. Typed paths overlap prior pointer tools as a related design, with explicit segment types and missing/null separation. Neither title differences nor hashes establish independent invention.",
